# Binary engineering assets. This repository stores them as ordinary Git blobs.
#
# Git LFS is intentionally NOT used: the preserved official reference assets were
# committed as plain blobs in the Codex history (commit c229948), that history is
# preserved rather than rewritten, and a mixed plain/LFS object store would make
# `reference-assets/MANIFEST.csv` checksum verification depend on whether the
# cloning machine happened to have git-lfs installed. See
# reports/CLAUDE_TAKEOVER_AUDIT.md, finding F-009.
*.step  -text
*.stp   -text
*.stl   -text
*.3mf   -text
*.pdf   -text
*.png   -text
*.jpg   -text
*.jpeg  -text
*.dxf   -text
